==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Osamu Mikumo & Cat (Rare Cat)|Osamu Mikumo & Cat]], [[Yuma Kuga & Cat (Rare Cat)|Yuma Kuga & Cat]] and [[Chika Amatori & Cat (Special Cat)|Chika Amatori & Cat]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Red Marmod]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Marmod]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Marmod]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Marmod]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Marmod]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Marmod]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The same strategy as for [[Training Level 1]] works here. You can easily beat this if your World Trigger units are level 20.

